/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Established in 1836, Emory is a progressive teaching, research and service university, comprised of nine major academic divisions and featuring numerous centers for research and advanced study, as well as a broad base of distinguished affiliates. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
