120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Led by President Gregory Fenves, the University has 15000 students and 3400 faculty members who represent all regions of the United States and more than 100 foreign nations. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
