/ActualText (Student life is as dynamic as it is diverse. With a student body of nearly 15,000, the university offers a thriving community where academic excellence meets rich extracurricular opportunities. More than 400 student organizations cater to a wide range of interests, from leadership and service to the arts and athletics, ensuring that every student finds a place to belong. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
