/ActualText (The Goizueta Full-time MBA program has an alternative grading format without a grade point average. Students receive grades of Distinguished \(DS\), High Performance \(HP\), Performance Standard \(PS\), Low Performance \(LP\) or No Credit \(NC\). Students are considered passing at all grade levels except for No Credit. There is a limit of two \(2\) grades of Low Performance in a semester. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
