200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (On-campus housing is limited. Most students should expect to reside in double-occupancy rooms at either Eagle Row or Clairmont Tower. The probability of receiving an on-campus housing assignment on the waitlist and timeline is dynamic)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
