207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Short-term, furnished leases are not common, but are available at some apartment complexes. Many exchange students sublet, negotiate rates through Airbnb or use the Off Campus Housing Finder or Emory Housing group on Facebook. The cost for a room for fall 2023 was about $1300 per person per month. Emory is  not able to make off-campus arrangements for you)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
