<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Health insurance is mandatory for all exchange visitors. Emory requires all degree-seeking students to have health insurance. Rates for insurance coverage vary each semester. All immunization costs are covered under the Emory Insurance. Students will be automatically enrolled in the Emory University Student Health Insurance Plan. Exchange students may elect to decline this coverage by completing the Waiver Option form, if they can show proof of sufficient alternative coverage with access to covered healthcare in Atlanta. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
