224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Emory has two state of the art recreation centers for its students. The Woodruff Physical Education Center is less than 5 minutes from the Goizueta Business School and includes an Olympic-sized pool, a rock climbing wall, weight training facilities, indoor and outdoor running tracks, indoor and outdoor tennis courts, four basketball courts and numerous racquetball, squash and badminton courts. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Student Activity & Academic Center also offers an outdoor Olympic-sized pool, indoor weight training facilities and numerous outdoor tennis courts. All facilities are free to students with a Student ID. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
